{"id": "63288", "title": "重生之我是大校的女儿", "author": "夜雨怜", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 83, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63288.htm", "intro": "#favorite_1{color:CC0000;font-weight:bold;border-style:double;}\r\n \r\n 本文超级玛丽苏，金手指全开，很多天雷狗血，不喜欢的就不要进来，我绝对不勉强啊，谢绝一些不好的评论，如果想说请您忍耐，到别处发泄。\r\n 别跟我讲这不和逻辑，原本就没有逻辑可言。\r\n 注：这是一篇慢热文，慎入！！！\r\n \r\n “你是我的女儿。”他第一次见到她毫不客气的说了一句。\r\n （第一次见面，叔叔，你见谁都这么打招呼吗？）\r\n “我看上你了，要你当我爸，你愿意吗？”傲然不忿的稚嫩脸颊和他如出一辙。\r\n （第二次见面，她率先发问，他囧了。）\r\n “爸，我和妈妈都在等你，你怎么在这里？”在军营，她不顾老妈的阻拦跑了过去，抱着他的大腿，好不可怜的望着他。\r\n （不知道第几次见到，不过这是我老爸，因为他们已经领证了。）\r\n \r\n 到这里本书全部完结，谢谢支持小夜的朋友们，请大家继续支持小夜的新文。\r\n 小夜承认自己写文不够成熟，不过却在成熟中……\r\n 新文：", "base": "files/article/html/63/63288", "chapters": [{"title": "chapter1", "file": "9364132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter2", "file": "9364133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter3", "file": "9364135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter4", "file": "9364144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter5", "file": "9364145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter6", "file": "9364146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter7", "file": "9364147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter8", "file": "9364148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter9", "file": "9364150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter10", "file": "9364152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter11", "file": "9364155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter12", "file": "9364157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter13", "file": "9364159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter14", "file": "9364161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter15", "file": "9364163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter16", "file": "9364164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter17", "file": "9364165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter18", "file": "9364166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter19", "file": "9364169.html", "available": f